    "kind": "definition_of_done",
    "summary": "- Invite tokens are 32 random bytes from crypto/rand, base64url-unpadded, stored only as SHA-256 hashes. Plaintext appears only in the invite email. No API response or snapshot contains it.\n- Accept returns 404 `invite_not_found` (unknown or revoked), 410 `invite_used`, or 410 `invite_expired` (older than 7 days on the service clock). A valid token accepts as before.\n- Re-inviting an address (case-insensitive) revokes the old pending invite. GET /v1/invites lists only pending invites, each with `expires_at`. Tests cover each behavior, and `go build`, `go test`, and `go vet` pass.",
